### register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "xeno",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "xeno",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### me test
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### calendar connect
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/connect?provider=google
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### calendar connection status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Manual sync calendar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### Get Calendar events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events?start=2026-02-22T23:00:00.000Z&end=2026-03-01T22:59:59.999Z
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Meeting Typ ändern
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/0hvm3g91r4is7rmu9ljb7u9kij/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "meetingType": "Stand-up"
}